WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.830
When a whole class passes,

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:06.306
I go back and check the marking.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:10.566
Dr Torun Ezeigwe directs our Master of Applied Measurement.

00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:16.596
A first-aid checklist with nineteen of its twenty-four boxes ticked on almost every sheet.

00:00:16.896 --> 00:00:20.676
Junior umpires, nearly ninety-nine per cent accredited,

00:00:20.826 --> 00:00:23.519
but under forty per cent first time.

00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:26.899
Two assessors walk the same empty rental,

00:00:27.049 --> 00:00:29.079
and agree least where the money is.

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:33.109
She's one of the ten most published researchers at Slop University.

00:00:33.809 --> 00:00:35.839
Two hundred and fourteen research outputs,

00:00:36.039 --> 00:00:38.139
cited nine hundred and seventy-seven times,

00:00:38.339 --> 00:00:40.459
with an h-index of twenty-five.

00:00:41.259 --> 00:00:43.720
We spend our lives being marked.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.660
The instrument earns scrutiny too.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.750
See her full list of outputs on our website,

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.080
follow us on Bluesky,

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:52.110
or write to us.
